Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Qualify the page's two transport statements by the
 transport in use

The opening sentence and the e_src_res paragraph said without condition
that the tags ride the passive-tracer path. Under the enthalpy audit they
do not, so both now name the default transport and point to the audit.

